      "contentHtml": "<p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"slide\"><div class=\"slide-title\"><span>Mẫu đàm thoại 1</span></div><div class=\"slide-content\"><p></p> <p> <img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" src=\"/images/minnamoi/bai45/renshuuC-1.jpg\" style=\"width: 300px;\"></p> <p> <audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/minnarenshuc/10001011110.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></p> <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"khung\" style=\" width: 100%;\"> <tbody> <tr> <td style=\"width: 60px;\"> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">キャンプの <ruby>予定<rp>(</rp><rt>よてい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は <ruby>以上<rp>(</rp><rt>いじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>か <ruby>質問<rp>(</rp><rt>しつもん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が ありますか。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Lịch trình của cắm trại đến đây là hết. Có câu hỏi gì hay không?</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>B: </span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">①<u><ruby>雨<rp>(</rp><rt>あめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が <ruby>降<rp>(</rp><rt>ふ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った</u> <ruby>場合<rp>(</rp><rt>ばあい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は、どう したら いいですか。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Trường hợp trời mưa thì làm thế nào thì được?</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">その <ruby>場合<rp>(</rp><rt>ばあい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は <ruby>電話<rp>(</rp><rt>でんわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で ②<u><ruby>聞<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いて</u> ください。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Trường hợp đó thì hãy hỏi bằng điện thoại.</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>B:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">はい。わかりました。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Vâng. Tôi biết rồi.</div></div></div></td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p> <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 128);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span><strong>Luyện tập: </strong></span></span></span></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><em><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">[thay thế vị trí gạch chân bằng nội dung bên dưới]</span></em></span></p> <p> <span>1)</span></p> <p> ① <ruby>時間<rp>(</rp><rt>じかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に <ruby>間<rp>(</rp><rt>あいだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に <ruby>会<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いません</p> <p> ② <ruby>知<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らせます</p> <p> <span>2)</span></p> <p> ① <ruby>急<rp>(</rp><rt>きゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に <ruby>都合<rp>(</rp><rt>つごう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が <ruby>悪<rp>(</rp><rt>わる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>く なりました</p> <p> ② <ruby>連絡<rp>(</rp><rt>れんらく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>します</p> <p> </p></div></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"slide\"><div class=\"slide-title\"><span>Mẫu đàm thoại 2</span></div><div class=\"slide-content\"><p></p> <p> <img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" src=\"/images/minnamoi/bai45/renshuuC-2.jpg\" style=\"width: 300px; \"></p> <p> <audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/minnarenshuc/10001011111.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></p> <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"khung\" style=\" width: 100%;\"> <tbody> <tr> <td style=\"width: 60px;\"> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">どう したんですか。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Làm sao thế?</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>B: </span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">この ①<u><ruby>傘<rp>(</rp><rt>かさ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby></u>、②<u><ruby>高<rp>(</rp><rt>たか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かった</u>のに、③<u>もう <ruby>壊<rp>(</rp><rt>こわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れて</u> しまったんです。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Cây dù này tuy giá cao nhưng mà hỏng mất rồi.</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">それは <ruby>残念<rp>(</rp><rt>ざんねん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Điều đó đáng tiếc nhỉ.</div></div></div></td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p> <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 128);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span><strong>Luyện tập: </strong></span></span></span></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><em><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">[thay thế vị trí gạch chân bằng nội dung bên dưới]</span></em></span></p> <p> <span>1)</span></p> <p> ① <ruby>服<rp>(</rp><rt>ふく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby></p> <p> ② １<ruby>回<rp>(</rp><rt>かい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しか <ruby>着<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>て いません</p> <p> ③ ここが <ruby>破<rp>(</rp><rt>やぶ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れます</p> <p> <span>2)</span></p> <p> ① かばん</p> <p> ② <ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の プレゼントです</p> <p> ③ <ruby>汚<rp>(</rp><rt>よご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>します</p> <p> </p></div></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"slide\"><div class=\"slide-title\"><span>Mẫu đàm thoại 3</span></div><div class=\"slide-content\"><p></p> <p> <img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" src=\"/images/minnamoi/bai45/renshuuC-3.jpg\" style=\"width: 300px; \"></p> <p> <audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/minnarenshuc/10001100000.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></p> <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"khung\" style=\" width: 100%;\"> <tbody> <tr> <td style=\"width: 60px;\"> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><ruby>田中<rp>(</rp><rt>たなか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さん、<ruby>今度<rp>(</rp><rt>こんど</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby> ①<u><ruby>結婚<rp>(</rp><rt>けっこん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する</u>んですよ。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Chị Tanaka, sắp tới sẽ kết hôn đấy.</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>B: </span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">えっ、<ruby>信<rp>(</rp><rt>しん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じられませんね。あんなに ②<u><ruby>独身<rp>(</rp><rt>どくしん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の ほうが いい</u>と <ruby>言<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>って いたのに、････。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Hả, không thể nào tin nổi. Mặc dù đã nói là độc thân tốt đến thế kia thế mà,…</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">そうですか。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Vậy à?</div></div></div></td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p> <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 128);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span><strong>Luyện tập: </strong></span></span></span></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><em><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">[thay thế vị trí gạch chân bằng nội dung bên dưới]</span></em></span></p> <p> <span>1)</span></p> <p> ① <ruby>海外旅行<rp>(</rp><rt>かいがいりょこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に <ruby>行<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きます</p> <p> ② <ruby>飛行機<rp>(</rp><rt>ひこうき</rt><rp>)</rp></ru